  "evidence_spans": [
    {
      "source_id": "bh1750",
      "page": 10,
      "snippet": "Slave Address is 2 types, it is determined by ADDR Terminal ADDR = 'H' (ADDR ≥ 0.7VCC ) → '1011100' ADDR = 'L' (ADDR ≤ 0.3VCC ) → '0100011'"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "bh1750",
      "page": 5,
      "snippet": "Instruction Set Architecture table: Power Down 0000_0000, Power On 0000_0001, Reset 0000_0111, Continuously H-Resolution Mode 0001_0000, etc."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "bh1750",
      "page": 5,
      "snippet": "Measurement Mode explanation: H-resolution Mode2 Typ. 120ms. 0.5 lx, H-Resolution Mode Typ. 120ms. 1 lx., L-Resolution Mode Typ. 16ms. 4 lx."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "bh1750",
      "page": 11,
      "snippet": "How to calculate when the data High Byte is \"10000011\" and Low Byte is \"10010000\" ( 2 15 + 2 9 + 2 8 + 2 7 + 2 4 ) / 1.2 ≒ 28067 [ lx ]"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "bh1750",
      "page": 12,
      "snippet": "H-reslution mode : Illuminance per 1 count ( lx / count )    = 1 / 1.2 *( 69 / X )"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "bh1750",
      "page": 12,
      "snippet": "H-reslution mode2 : Illuminance per 1 count ( lx / count )    = 1 / 1.2 *( 69 / X ) / 2"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "bh1750",
      "page": 12,
      "snippet": "changable range of MTreg binary 0001_1111 ( sensitivity : default * 0.45 ) ... 0100_0101 default ... 1111_1110 ( sensitivity : default * 3.68 )"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "bh1750",
      "page": 2,
      "snippet": "H-Resolution Mode Measurement Time t HR Typ. 120 ms Max. 180 ms"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "bh1750",
      "page": 2,
      "snippet": "L-Resolution Mode Measurement Time t LR Typ. 16 ms Max. 24 ms"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "bh1750",
      "page": 2,
      "snippet": "I2C SCL Clock Frequency f SCL Max. 400 kHz"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "bh1750",
      "page": 6,
      "snippet": "DVI is I2C bus reference voltage terminal. And it is also asynchronous reset terminal. It is necessary to set to 'L' after VCC is supplied."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "bh1750",
      "page": 13,
      "snippet": "DVI Terminal: please set to 'L' ( at least 1µs, DVI <= 0.4V ) after VCC is supplied."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "bh1750",
      "page": 4,
      "snippet": "Data Register → This is for registration of Ambient Light Data. Initial Value is \"0000_0000_0000_0000\"."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "bh1750",
      "page": 4,
      "snippet": "Measurement Time Register → This is for registration of measurement time. Initial Value is \"0100_0101\"."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "bh1750",
      "page": 5,
      "snippet": "Reset command is for only reset Illuminance data register. ( reset value is '0' )"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "bh1750",
      "page": 4,
      "snippet": "\"Power On\" Command is possible to omit."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "bh1750",
      "page": 10,
      "snippet": "BH1750FVI is not able to accept plural command without stop condition. Please insert SP every 1 Opecode."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "bh1750",
      "page": 11,
      "snippet": "Wait to complete 1st    H-resolution mode measurement.( max. 180ms. )"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "bh1750",
      "page": 12,
      "snippet": "It is possilbe to detect 0.23lx by using this function at H-resolution mode. And it is possilbe to detect 0.11lx by using this function at H-resolution mode2."
    }
  ],
